Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining. Running forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with us, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mods will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a baffling bombshell\Nto that Alto battle, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that all twenty-something\Nremaining brawlers have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,somehow been knocked unconscious\NWhat is this twist of events?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen anything like this in\Nthe history of the Corridor Coliseum,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do my eyes deceive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can make out the figure\Nof someone struggling to stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:03:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this potentially be our winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the fighter responsible\Nfor our shock and awe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca is our lone survivor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we have seen a spectacular showcase of fan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,favorites and behemoth frontrunners today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, shockingly, not one remains standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The contestant who will be\Nmoving into the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And our Corita Battle\NTournament block D winner is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievably, from the bloodline of the\Ndisgraced King Rick, the prisoner gladiator,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how she did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All I noticed was a cloud of\Ndust, then everyone went belly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the details really matter here, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca gets to move on to the next round!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this! She cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She made Cavendish? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I call shenanigans!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral O 'Lumbus wouldn't lose to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the slicing winds of Rommel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There was quite the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Years ago, there was an odd\Nphenomenon tormenting Rommel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was said that late at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,terrorizing gusts of wind would slice right\Nthrough the kingdom's innocent citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:05:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A naval unit was dispatched\Nto investigate the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, these wins also claimed\Nthe lives of a few good men that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we did come to learn the\Ncause of that dreadful cutting zephyr?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Disturbingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it was a human responsible for the callous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,attacks—a man who referred\Nto himself as Akuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,akuba
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably to this very day,\Nthe fiend remains at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after the incident in Rommel Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,there have been similar reports\Nof Hakuba in other regions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And wherever Haki has been sighted,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,there just so happens to be another\Npirate around at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You did not steal my blade wench!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a sleepwalker. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakuba only awakens while\NCavendish is fast asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One could even refer to\Nhim as a sort of alter ego,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it's technically\NHaki who killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cavendish had no other choice but\Nto become a pirate as a consequence;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of feel bad for the poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your pity on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool relishes in the\Nnotoriety this brings him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Indulge in sympathy and he\Nmight best you, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He is already a prodigy\Nswordsman as is but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakuba's skills could\Nput Cavendishes to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he still has to fall\Nasleep to have his alter ego appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so as you can imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that doesn't always play out as\Nplanned, especially in a battle royale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Rebecca won this Serger;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she has a best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, she dominated that\Nwithout landing a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Always more than one way to win a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it came\Ndown to just luck either,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,as she was the only one to\Nsee through Hakuba's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter who the winner may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let them get their\Nhands on the flame flame fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.68,0:08:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Goody, I was getting antsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The finals are finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.78,0:09:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See that, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your granddaughter sure is\Nlucky, if I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd have guessed that\Nthis little fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,tournament would become a family affair?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Willing to throw some elbows for\Na bite of Devil Fruit, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how low the mighty hath fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed that your entire family\Nhas been acting a bit off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And that includes sweet\Nlittle Violet's betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really believe in coincidences.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have to explain my motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But the actions you took this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We journeyed to your island to\Naddress rumors concerning Doflamingo's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,abdication of the throne and\Nretirement from the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a false report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:09:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It reignited my passion\Nto want to stand up and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,fight for everything in\Nthe kingdom once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that heroic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Still trying to earn the\Npeople's favor after so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But Viola must have her own motivations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, she would never be\Ncaught acting on her emotions alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A cunning and calculating tramp, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet she's weighing eruptions now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She put so much stock in this rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But look what's become of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And that boy, who became famous two years\Nago with the demon blood in his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine the ignorant shrew was banking\Non those two heroes to strike me down cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet here's law, barely clinging to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:11:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And Straw Hat will never\Nget to leave the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as a human being, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As of right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the only member of the Straw Hat crew\Nwho's doing anything is that cyborg Franky,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,who's reportedly attacking the\Ntoy house unassisted as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have faith my family\Nexecutives will take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His other allies, the pirate hunter Zoro,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Firefox Kin'emon, Niko Robin,\Nand Sniper King remain at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I highly doubt they can get\Nanywhere near my underground factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,job down here is pretty easy you\Njust keep all these toys and lies
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah that's it seems simple enough\Nbut i really don't know much about
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,this stuff so you think you can show\Nme i learned better from example
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,there's gonna be a lift just up ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The palace where Doflamingo\Nis lurking, the toy house,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and the treeport where the Smile\NFactory is located are all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, infiltrating the palace\Nallows us to ingress the other locations?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,To get access to the factory,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to either pass through the\Npalace or enter through the toy house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The only other way inside\Nis through the trade
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,port in a secret tunnel\Nthat my people and I dug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The most direct route for us\Nto take is through the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm still in a state\Nof disbelief over such we folk,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,in spite of one standing\Nbefore my very eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these guys are great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:12:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like a toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're told that we shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only supposed to allow the big\Npeople of the royal family to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But you guys, the Straw Hat Pirates\Nare the exception to that rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Usulunders?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to explain\Nall the details now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation SOP is already underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can see it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the lift entrance to the\Npalace I was telling you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The only problem is, to use the lift, we\Nhave to show a pass to a security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just kick his butt. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make a huge scene, it'll\Njust bring us unnecessary attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's up? Don't tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help guide\Nyou into the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time for the final round!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,have shockingly announced their\Nwithdrawal from the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at a loss here, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a treat in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Subbing in is none other\Nthan our Coliseum's hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be showing up in the finals\Nand throwing down on their stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him to the medical room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the finals, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you're worthy\Nof speaking to him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must be Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually rather familiar\Nwith your backstory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to cause a bit\Nof commotion here shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I swear I won't do you wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about putting on\Nappearances around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something about this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but think\Nof the place I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We've caught wind that one needs\Na sort of pass to enter the lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,While the lift would take you directly\Nto the palace entrance, it's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out who\Nyou are, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And more importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You look suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam, I'm offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the one who lured\Nour idiot cook-away earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:15:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet, my sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and he hurried off\Nto protect your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, we knew the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were the one who told him\Nthe Sonny was in trouble, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then perchance did you provide Sir Sanji\Nwith the map to the toy house as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you acquire such an item?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was one of Doflamingo's\Nsubordinates. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But she was only\Npretending to be a bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wicca, it's you! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you actually remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, did you forget about my ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been keeping a close watch\Non your people this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I also know about the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting alongside the brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,one-legged soldier who's been looking\Nafter Rebekah since my sister passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick will return to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for still\Nbelieving in my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Yola!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.03,0:17:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So wait, you're a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.90,0:17:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you turn it down a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If Rebecca's the king's granddaughter,\Nthat makes you... what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca is my niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the daughter of my\Nlate older sister, Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A hidden door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've seen everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A princess and a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,user
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,is a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,secret escape passage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Rick family not even\NDoflamingo knows that it's here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,is this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,comically large baskets purpose it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,pulley for lifting cargo look up hmm\Nlooks like it reaches all the way to the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Top and I spy a fine staircase as well.\NNow if you follow the flight of steps
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,up you'll reach the rampart tower
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,where the entrance is located uh luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,how about you make this easy on everyone\Nand grab this boulder here and shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself up oh quite a novel solution if\Nyou can bring the chains once atop and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,cascade back down we can traverse upwards\Nwith ease that sounds like Madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it snappy, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please join us for the\Nride upward, Madam Ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, what is this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky! Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was launch from the cannon\Non his head, but I guess not, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, use your dive ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can clean your teeth with\Na shoe shine brush later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such a hard-boiled guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor Pink, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor Pink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you use your\Npowers to dodge that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't make blind\Nassumptions about others, you pumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I use my swim-swim-fruit\Npowers on my own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can move through walls and floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But under no circumstances ever will\NI use it to run away from the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go for a swim when I feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to ramble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that brandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's bleeding all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he broke a bone or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's cleansing his wounds with brandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, you're way too good for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:21:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've put your life at\Nrisk and took a hit head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,because you knew your calling\Nwas incapacitated behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My tummy's hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, I would die for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't dwell on the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Make love to me, Señor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vice, can you stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that guy's hard-boiled as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dum-tum, the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, must have missed a gain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit moving around like\Nsome vermin, dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the super hell is with you guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyborg Franky and the Straw Hat Pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:22:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be seizing the toy house, so\Nbetter surrender to us now! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's the Navy interfering? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recall ordering more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.74,0:22:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thrilled you made the\Nright choice, Fujitora.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not ready to declare where I\Nstand in these complicated matters just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take risks with Straw Hat\Nafoot and with other suspicious
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.42,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,parties getting involved—considered\Na precautionary measure,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,our choice was made for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.30,0:22:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,navy's primary priority is to curtail the\Nsuffering of small folk in this scuffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.42,0:22:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.42,0:22:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's intention is to take you down,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd wager he'd do\Nthat with little little
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,regard for anything or anyone in his path.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:23:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And if my sense of justice is correct,\Nthose humble folks will need my assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that is settled, I'll be\Ntaking care of you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I may be a newcomer to this game,\Nrecruited through the world military draft,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but since I was appointed to\Nthe position of navy admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.46,0:23:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a simple goal in\Nmind till I bear witness to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the complete abolition of this\Naccursed seven warlord system.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.06,0:23:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A time back there was a\Npirate who came in like a ball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,of fire and attempted to force\Nhis will over some kingdom;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.04,0:23:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon if he had his way, that land\Nwould be in a similar state as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.38,0:23:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think will happen\Nto the balance of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue, we won't figure that\Nout till it's demolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if you keep up this\Nfoolish reign of terror,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.02,0:23:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:23:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,price
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.59,0:24:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,on your head
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.51,0:24:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,will only increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly demon, did I mishear you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said, "off me."\NNow, while you have the chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,let's not be hasty; we can operate\Nunder a gentleman's agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My only objective is to\Nprotect your kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.36,0:24:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so any sort of rough edges that\NI may accidentally happen upon,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.62,0:24:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to turn a blind eye too,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.14,0:24:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and rest assured that's the\Nonly kind of eye I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that we have the reverie\Nworld summit coming up this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This world's going to be changing,\Nwhether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Corridor Coliseum Battle\NTournament continues on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.78,0:24:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, the final round!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.94,0:25:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the kingdom is watching as\Nwe lock the special ring into place now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.50,0:25:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We will soon find out when our\Nfinal five contenders duke it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.56,0:25:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lie, I'm pretty excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.22,0:25:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get to it, Marine Coliseo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.08,0:25:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bartolomeo, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.02,0:25:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, our first contender\Nis marching in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.30,0:25:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, it's our surprise fightless\Nand wayward wanderer, none other
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.10,0:25:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,than
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.01,0:25:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.93,0:25:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,hope
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.48,0:25:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you're watching over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace.
